# Google Search API 配置模板

## 基础配置

```json
{
  "name": "google-search",
  "description": "Google Custom Search API 配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "api": "customsearch",
  "config": {
    "apiKey": "${GOOGLE_SEARCH_API_KEY}",
    "searchEngineId": "${GOOGLE_SEARCH_CX}",
    "options": {
      "num": 10,
      "start": 0,
      "lr": "lang_zh-CN",
      "sort": "",
      "safe": "active",
      "searchType": "",
      "fileType": "",
      "rights": ""
    }
  },
  "features": [
    "Web 搜索",
    "图片搜索",
    "新闻搜索",
    "视频搜索"
  ],
  "setup": {
    "getApiKey": "https://developers.google.com/custom-search/v1/overview",
    "createCx": "https://programmablesearchengine.google.com/",
    "quota": "100 次/天（免费版）"
  },
  "usage": {
    "web": {
      "searchType": "",
      "description": "普通 Web 搜索"
    },
    "image": {
      "searchType": "image",
      "description": "图片搜索"
    },
    "news": {
      "searchType": "news",
      "description": "新闻搜索"
    }
  }
}
```

## 使用示例

```bash
curl "https://www.googleapis.com/customsearch/v1?key=$GOOGLE_SEARCH_API_KEY&cx=$GOOGLE_SEARCH_CX&q=OpenClaw"
```

## 文件位置
`templates/google-ai/google-search-config.json`
